Refined **A** - BuildLedger India v2.0 is ready. I polished the same app into a production-ready design.

### What's refined in A v2:

**Design:** Clean white + emerald theme, mobile responsive, collapsible sidebar, better empty states & toasts
**Attendance:** `By Role` is now default, no name field in that mode, add new roles inline, shifts/day, Saturday billing auto-grouped Mon-Sun
**Stock:** One-click `Sort by: Material | Site | Category` + low-stock badge
**M-Book:** True Project-wise / Client-wise toggle + filter + auto quantity abstract
**Tools:** Civil Calculator [IS 456], Unit Converter, and Right-Angle [3-4-5] are now 3 separate tools with IS disclaimer
**New:** Dashboard charts, CSV/JSON Backup export, Search in all registers, Better validation

Copy -> Save as `buildledger-v2.html` -> Open in any browser. Works offline, data saved in this device.

